abstract: >-
  Cuba Geographic Data provides administrative and hydrographic datasets for
  Cuba, including geographic names, administrative boundaries, river and channel
  centerlines, catchments, water-body polygons, coastline and land polygons.
  Version v2.0.0 adds consolidated water names, hydrographic geometry, reference
  tables and self-contained Jupyter examples, with product metadata, field
  definitions, checksums and licenses specified per dataset.
